AMQPlainAuth to redact passwords from logs/reflection/APM dumps, and zeroes
out the plaintext SASL passwords in Connection.Config.SASL once openComplete
runs. The Reconnect()/Recovery restoration hunk and its unit tests are
intentionally omitted because that recovery infrastructure does not exist in
v1.10.0. A replacement regression test is provided for openComplete zeroing.

